{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10105060","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10105060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1010506001:0":{"text":"페... 페기?!","source_cn":"佩……佩吉？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633AAC70CF20CD8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010506002:2":{"text":"하... 그게 약혼녀에게 할 인사인가요?!","source_cn":"呵，这就是你见到未婚妻的态度吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13A1D983DCA6E6DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010506003:0":{"text":"당신이 계속 날 피해 다니는 바람에 쫓아오느라 반지를 동쪽 백사장에 떨어뜨렸다고요!","source_cn":"你不肯见我，一路躲来躲去。为了追上你，我的戒指都掉在了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73B154466D28D855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010506004:2":{"text":"거기 두 사람, 뭘 그냥 보고 있는 거야? 어서 가서 찾아오지 못해?","source_cn":"你们这俩大个子，愣着干什么？还不快去帮我找！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43CE3AB0281F215E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010506005:0":{"text":"우리? 우리가 왜 네 말을 들어야 하지?","source_cn":"我们？！我们凭什么要听你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC6428AA8BD5E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010506006:0":{"text":"페기 공주님께 무례하게 굴지 마라!","source_cn":"不得对佩吉公主无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x901E89E49B7D389A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010506007:0":{"text":"공주...?","source_cn":"公主……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E39446B890AAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010506008:0":{"text":"방금 왜 내 말을 들어야 하는지 물었지?","source_cn":"你刚刚不是问，为什么要听我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DBEADEA148C582A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010506009:0":{"text":"내가 오늘 기분이 좀 좋아서, 반지를 찾아오는 사람에게 그걸 선물로 주려고 해. ","source_cn":"因为本公主今天心情很好，如果有人找到那枚戒指，我就会把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84A022E19511E91B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010506010:0":{"text":"빨간 보석으로 장식된 반지인데, 로드 프란츠의 저택 같은 건 사고도 남을 값비싼 물건이지!","source_cn":"戒指上可镶嵌着红宝石呢，即便用它买下弗朗茨的宅邸都绰绰有余。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02903E4EECF03480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010506011:0":{"text":"어딨지! 반지는 내 것이다!","source_cn":"在哪！戒指在哪！是我的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AE7F1302FA5296F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010506012:0":{"text":"로완, 괜찮아요. 친구들은 무사히 다 들어갔네요!","source_cn":"罗万，没事啦。你那几个朋友已经溜进去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3B4FF3BB3335F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010506013:0":{"text":"하하, 오랜만이야. 블레다크! 이렇게 많이 컸다니!","source_cn":"哈哈，好久不见啊。布拉达克一世都长得这么大了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4D32BFBD79B5C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1010506014:0":{"text":"꽤애액...!","source_cn":"嘎——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95DC2784F502DBD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1010506015:0":{"text":"페기, 당신이 어떻게... 여기 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"佩吉，你怎么……会在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x364DDD41425C27BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1010506016:0":{"text":"당연히 당신을 보기 위해서죠. 성석 마을에 갔을 때 미스릴 상회의 사람이 저에게 당신이 프란츠 장원의 연회에 참석하러 갔다는 걸 알려줬어요.","source_cn":"当然是为了见你。我去了圣石镇，秘银商会的人和我说，你来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x979A4CB59844398E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010506017:0":{"text":"여긴 너무 위험해요, 특히 당신에게는요.","source_cn":"这地方很危险，尤其是对你而言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D1469D487CAEEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010506018:0":{"text":"당신은 미스릴 상회의 후계자잖아요. 이들에게 당신은 눈엣가시라고요.","source_cn":"别忘了，你可是秘银商会的少爷，在这些人看来，你是一枚亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD72BA31047F119EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010506019:0":{"text":"...눈엣가시?","source_cn":"……眼中钉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282225B398B4D19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1010506020:0":{"text":"계속 밖에서 지내느라 모르는 게 많군요?","source_cn":"你最近一直在外游历，很多事都不知道吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B55005BB2AFAF2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1010506021:0":{"text":"거대한 음모가 일어나고 있어요, 로완. 그 중심에는 로드 프란츠가 있고요!","source_cn":"暂且不说太远，在你眼前——这座庄园的主人……便是是这场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C6378CD6D6D66FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑金打手":{"text":"블랙골드 경호원","source":"黑金打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:耀光士兵":{"text":"병사","source":"耀光士兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布拉达克一世":{"text":"블레다크 1세","source":"布拉达克一世","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":5}}